# ── Never publish ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live account databases and per-machine config. data/nova.db holds real accounts.
**/data/
*.db
*.db.tmp
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/certs/
*.log
*.dmp

# The updater signing key must never be near this repo — it lives in
# %USERPROFILE%\.nova-updater\. Belt and braces in case it is ever copied in.
*.key
nova-updater*

# ── Build output and dependencies (all regenerable) ─────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/dist/
**/x64/
**/.vs/
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib

# Staged installer payload: ~136 MB of binaries rebuilt by the release process.
# See RELEASING.md for how to recreate it.
Launcher/src-tauri/resources/

# ── Local snapshots and scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
_backup-*/
Nova-Multiplayer-Test/
Nova-Multiplayer-Test.zip
